        "desc": "<p><strong>砂に埋もれた秘話・ネフェル</strong></p><p></p><p>秘密を暴き、数多の心を覗き見る。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/07/02/358253410/6ae0c51cca34b6f92bf340719d0b8a98_6928394185491278623.png",
